  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MFP-SME Sekerbank Sustainability Loan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed investment in Sekerbank is expected to increase access to finance for MSMEs, including women-owned, Agri, and rural MSMEs and climate financing for MSMEs in T&#xfc;rkiye. Additionally, the project will promote sustainable finance adoption of sustainable within T&#xfc;rkiye&apos;s banking sector and foster improvements in the quality and robustness of measurement and reporting practice.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed investment is a senior unsecured sustainability MSME loan of up to US$100 million to Sekerbank T.A.S. (Sekerbank or the Bank), a long-standing IFC partner in T&#xfc;rkiye, to support the expansion of the Banks sustainability lending program to Micro, Small, and Medium Enterprises (MSMEs). The use of proceeds will be allocated to the following sub-segments: women-owned MSMEs (WMSMEs), Agri MSMEs, climate financing for MSMEs, and MSMEs in rural areas.</narrative>
  </description>
